      "content": "that makes sense. i guess we just need tighter control. but i'm also thinking about the \"human\" element of the gates. like, how do we handle those small, annoying little errors that somehow bypass all the automated checks and just show up right when the deployment is live? those tiny little things that seem to sneak past every guard we put in place.",
