      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "For these elusive, \"human-bypassing\" errors, implement robust post-deployment monitoring using Application Performance Monitoring (APM) tools. These tools provide real-time visibility into production metrics, capturing errors that automation couldn't predict. Crucially, establish clear observability dashboards and set automated alerts for anomalies, allowing rapid human intervention before minor bugs turn into major outages. This shifts from \"prevention\" to \"instant detection and response.\"",
      "source": "target",
